Source: sdxi-cli
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SDXI Maintainers <wei.huang2@amd.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               meson (>= 0.61),
               ninja-build,
               pkg-config,
               autoconf,
               automake,
               libtool
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/AMDESE/sdxi-cli

Package: sdxi-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command-line tool for SDXI devices and drivers
 sdxi-cli is the user-space command-line interface for SDXI (Smart Data
 Accelerator Interface) devices. It uses libsdxi to talk to the kernel
 SDXI driver and exposes device discovery, attribute management, and AMD
 QoS extensions.
